WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.608 --> 00:00:10.510
The yellow box reports the status of
the current position: no clashes.

2
00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:18.454
While dragging, the pills show
what each spot would cost.

3
00:00:18.554 --> 00:00:24.457
Here: 15 students clash (red)
and a teacher clash (purple).

4
00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:30.460
“Áhrif breytingar” (effect of the
change): before → after.

5
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:35.463
PRÓ124F shares 15 students,
and prufa1 teaches it then.

6
00:00:35.563 --> 00:00:41.465
Room HT-104: ⛔ – it is booked in
TermTime. A booking would fail.

7
00:00:41.565 --> 00:00:45.468
Bóka (book) is blocked
while a ⛔ stands.

8
00:00:45.568 --> 00:00:55.570
Thursday in V02-152: ⚠ – PRÓ124F's
lab has it in Núverandi lausn.

9
00:00:55.670 --> 00:01:04.451
Friday 10:00 is free:
no pills, no clashes.

10
00:01:04.551 --> 00:01:10.454
Tímafjöldi: number of 50-minute
slots. 3 makes it longer.

11
00:01:10.554 --> 00:01:15.456
Tegund (type): what kind of
session, as in TermTime.

12
00:01:15.556 --> 00:01:20.459
Athugasemd (note) goes to the
room administrators.

13
00:01:20.559 --> 00:01:25.460
Weeks: click on and off –
here week 9 is left out.

14
00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:30.626
One save for all of it:
Staðfesta og vista.

15
00:01:30.726 --> 00:01:36.628
A booked (green) session: dragging
only marks it for rebooking.

16
00:01:36.728 --> 00:01:40.631
Núllstilla (reset)
puts it back.

17
00:01:40.731 --> 00:01:47.035
Bóka (book) and Uppfæra bókun
(update booking): live soon.

18
00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:12.388
On any course: try freely,
then Núllstilla. Nothing is saved.
